      "description": "Leave it to Manus - The AI agent that doesn't just think, it delivers.\n\nManus is a general AI agent that bridges mind and action. Unlike\nchatbots that stop at generating text, Manus uses its own virtual \"computer\"\nto autonomously plan, research, write code, and deliver a finished product.\nIt works asynchronously in the cloud—close the app and Manus keeps working,\nnotifying you when your task is complete.\n\nADVANCED SPREADSHEETS & DATA ANALYSIS\n- Instantly handle complex financial modeling, data analysis, and automated\nreporting.\n- Transform raw Excel or CSV data into clear visual insights and interactive\ndashboards.\n\nBOARDROOM-QUALITY SLIDES\n- Generate complete, polished slide decks tailored to your needs with one\nprompt.\n- Manus handles structure, design, and content—ready to present in a\nboardroom, classroom, or online.\n\nDESIGN VIEW & MEDIA GENERATION\n- Create and edit images with precision on an interactive canvas.\n- Transform simple text prompts into high-quality images and complete video\nstories.\n\nSMARTER WIDE RESEARCH\n- Powered by the Manus 1.6 Max architecture, conduct deep, accurate, and comprehensive web research.\n- Multiple sub-agents work in parallel to synthesize findings and draft\ndetailed reports automatically.\n\nFREE & UNLIMITED CHAT\n- Ask any question and get instant, accurate answers.\n- One-click upgrade to Agent Mode for complex, multi-step execution.\n\nTHE MANUS DIFFERENCE\n- Asynchronous Cloud Execution: Close the app. Manus keeps working. Get\nnotified when done.\n- Autonomous Task Decomposition: Complex requests are broken into a to-do\nlist and executed step by step.\n- Always in Control: Stop, edit, or redirect your task at any time.\n\nTasks that used to take 20 hours can now be done in 1. Download Manus and\nput your work on autopilot.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://manus.im/privacy\nTerms of Use: https://manus.im/terms",
